79:     already exist -- so a new #define would add a name it does not mention and
80:     compile clean.  *** BOTH LEGS WERE REFUTED BY MEASUREMENT on #466's pass 2,
81:     independently by two seats, one of which BUILT ALL FOUR VARIANTS: ***
82:       - the C11 leg ruled out one SPELLING, not compile-time checking.  The
83:         negative-width bitfield idiom below needs only C89, and is clean under
