87:       - the shape leg analysed the wrong placement.  A STANDALONE assert does
88:         compile clean on the feared edit -- MEASURED.  A check INSIDE the macro
89:         does not: it fires at the RAISE, so it cannot be bypassed by adding a
90:         name.  MEASURED: `#define SYSASIC_EVENT_FOO 96` plus a raise is a hard
