I found a stronger challenge to `sh4pcic15`: the priority formula gives slot 15 priority zero even if the loop is extended, and Renesas defines encoded IRL value 15 as “no interrupt request.” I also found a missed candidate in the 73: `sh4sqwrite` describes an actual missing protection check on guest stores, despite its test-oriented title and “none yet” witness field.
